{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_38", "source_id": "6336bc47000000001d013a93", "title": "细腻皮肤的干货来了", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6336bc47000000001d013a93", "topic_family": "抗老与紧致", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 882, "evidence_unit_count": 22, "original_evidence_unit_count": 22, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我是长达9年的油痘肌肤质，但现在皮肤还挺细腻光滑的", "所以这一瓶，又能细腻皮肤、缩小毛孔，还能抗老、提亮肤色", "用了一段时间，明显感觉我的皮肤细腻了，而且很有光泽，提亮效果还挺明显的", "SINCE 1851 KIEHL'S DERMATOLOGIST", "1.0fl.oz.-30ml 抹开是乳液质地 非常好吸收～", "但是在秋冬天，天气比较干燥的情况下，我会在A醇精华后面再加个保湿面霜", "但科颜氏这款A醇精华，我用在脸颊上也完全可以，皮肤不会出现不耐受反应（我是在脸颊皮肤健康状态下试的，还处于敏敏状况的宝子不能学我哦"], "retained_quotes": ["但是在秋冬天，天气比较干燥的情况下，我会在A醇精华后面再加个保湿面霜", "但科颜氏这款A醇精华，我用在脸颊上也完全可以，皮肤不会出现不耐受反应（我是在脸颊皮肤健康状态下试的，还处于敏敏状况的宝子不能学我哦"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6336bc47000000001d013a93/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6336bc47000000001d013a93/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6336bc47000000001d013a93/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6336bc47000000001d013a93/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "ee9a4234c36919b41f5ca4abbb9366298921e6b100c79fc76b83cfcee6aaf2ee", "card_hash": "ac59e0bb372752228017ea659b85339dcc7d2d0ec5a0c1c14514fa647019218c", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_38", "source_id": "63313c9c0000000017025e22", "title": "人人都羡慕的妈生好皮护肤思路分享", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63313c9c0000000017025e22", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "identity_proof", "commercial_axis": "正常经验内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 723, "evidence_unit_count": 22, "original_evidence_unit_count": 22, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 68, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天想跟寶寶們分享一下 如何用護膚品", "外人看我們的皮膚好不好 就是看我們這層表面皮膚的狀態 所以我們臉上的腳趾層", "皮膚就會看起來很柔嫩 細膩有光澤 就是這個Tacami的小藍瓶精華", "不那麼容易長壁口 毛孔也看起來小的一點 而且持續使用期間我很放心", "我就分享給你們了 寶寶們一定要注意 調理好自己的腳趾哦", "我們在洗完臉之後第一步 用一刻度先滴在手上 然後用手心溫熱後輕柔按壓一下上臉", "外人看我們的皮膚好不好 就是看我們這層表面皮膚的狀態 所以我們臉上的腳趾層"], "retained_quotes": ["我們在洗完臉之後第一步 用一刻度先滴在手上 然後用手心溫熱後輕柔按壓一下上臉", "外人看我們的皮膚好不好 就是看我們這層表面皮膚的狀態 所以我們臉上的腳趾層"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63313c9c0000000017025e22/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63313c9c0000000017025e22/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63313c9c0000000017025e22/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63313c9c0000000017025e22/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "84c5797065e41d11fd4b29bbe76c6721662d1109feb09a5add22e63fe3a7e423", "card_hash": "e5461ea21eaf9d50615c863130bef816b3227012fded3b3b00d9c8aafb760881", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_38", "source_id": "6322e611000000000800baf0", "title": "完全不输大牌的油痘肌平价好用物🌟", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6322e611000000000800baf0", "topic_family": "眼周护理", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1234, "evidence_unit_count": 37, "original_evidence_unit_count": 37, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 113, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小三菱 今天我要给你们分享三款完全不输大牌的品价好用户夫品", "而且很便宜大碗 这一罐有400毫升才卖几十块钱 它是这种精华水的质地", "你用多少你就挤多少 不怕浪费 而且也更方便和卫生 它里面虽然有三种酸", "我们的眼周会出现皱纹 是从这些干纹开始的 那你用眼油把眼周肌肤滋润了之后", "希望你们会喜欢 那我们下期见 拜拜", "但是我还是会经常拿它出来用 因为它确实用起来还蛮舒服的 它的油杆很轻薄", "眼睛有点不舒服 我的眼周护理就是一般会先用一个 眼油滋润眼周之后再擦一个眼霜"], "retained_quotes": ["但是我还是会经常拿它出来用 因为它确实用起来还蛮舒服的 它的油杆很轻薄", "眼睛有点不舒服 我的眼周护理就是一般会先用一个 眼油滋润眼周之后再擦一个眼霜"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6322e611000000000800baf0/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6322e611000000000800baf0/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6322e611000000000800baf0/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6322e611000000000800baf0/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "9caca3648b43faf91c76ccb9ac880f8c721d00566fcd418da527075ad7ae3487", "card_hash": "4c73fe6af12b63feced79c8afc60dd01c877f66189b4daf97eb18667397d8ffd", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_38", "source_id": "631995c7000000001203b8fe", "title": "油痘肌告别黑头、闭口、痘痘的精简护肤方式", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_631995c7000000001203b8fe", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 738, "evidence_unit_count": 22, "original_evidence_unit_count": 22, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 58, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["哈嘍 我是小森林 今天我想跟各位紅薯寶寶能分享一下 如何從根源處解決我們的黑頭蛙痘痘閉口的問題", "我發現了一套專門為我們油痘機而研發的控油水乳 裡面的成分全是對我們油痘機非常友好的成分", "它是根據我們皮膚的一個出油量來進行工作的 不會過作的干預", "雖然它是精華水 但它也完全是一瓶水的質地 裡面有包裹性的水洋酸", "我就分享給你們囉 希望你們會喜歡", "就是因為他們不出油 所以如果我們能做好控油 就是從根源處把一些問題給解決了", "如果你跟我一樣是混合性肌膚 那全臉擦完了這一套之後 再臉頰觸再稍微擦一點清爽"], "retained_quotes": ["就是因為他們不出油 所以如果我們能做好控油 就是從根源處把一些問題給解決了", "如果你跟我一樣是混合性肌膚 那全臉擦完了這一套之後 再臉頰觸再稍微擦一點清爽"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_631995c7000000001203b8fe/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_631995c7000000001203b8fe/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_631995c7000000001203b8fe/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_631995c7000000001203b8fe/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "36bec861e15a99ba2ce33b944d209f54d5fa9c2ad2bc17b169d148defb45db35", "card_hash": "2ecd6df8633cde7b8d7e7af0633ae62487e72ef508ec59f96316c62813e5b5d6", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
